==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Hitmonlee|42}} from the {{TCG|Neo Destiny}} expansion.
*'''Stretch Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Hitmonlee|7}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Hitmonlee}}.

